@startuml
title 근거 선택 capability 구조
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "Adventure 내부 shared application package capability" {
  class EvidenceAcquisitionApplicationService {
    +EvidenceAcquisitionResult acquire(EvidenceSearchRequest request)
  }
  interface UnifiedCandidateSearchPort
  interface EvidenceRerankerPort
  interface EvidenceSufficiencyJudgePort
  interface EvidenceSufficiencyPolicy {
    +PolicyId policyId()
    +Set<DocumentType> selectDocumentTypes(PolicyInput input)
    +EvidenceTaskContext buildTaskContext(PolicyInput input)
    +SufficiencyInstruction buildInstruction(EvidenceTaskContext context)
    +FinalInsufficiency mapFinalInsufficiency(SufficiencyDecision d, PolicyInput input)
  }
  class PlayerActionEvidenceSufficiencyPolicy
  class ScenarioPreparationEvidenceSufficiencyPolicy
  class OpeningSceneEvidenceSufficiencyPolicy
  class RuleGuidanceEvidenceSufficiencyPolicy
  class EvidenceCandidatePool
  class EvidenceRerankRequest
  class EvidenceRerankResult
  class EvidenceSufficiencyRequest
  class SufficiencyDecision
  class FinalInsufficiency
  class EvidenceAcquisitionResult
  class AdventureValidatorAndFinalizer
}

package "AI Game Master (stateless)" {
  class EvidenceController
  class EvidenceRerankerService
  class EvidenceSufficiencyJudgeService
  interface ModelPort
  class ModelAdapter
  EvidenceController --> EvidenceRerankerService : internal rerank API
  EvidenceController --> EvidenceSufficiencyJudgeService : internal judge API
  EvidenceRerankerService --> ModelPort
  EvidenceSufficiencyJudgeService --> ModelPort
  ModelPort <|.. ModelAdapter
}

class RuleKnowledgeHttpGateway
class AiGameMasterHttpGateway
UnifiedCandidateSearchPort <|.. RuleKnowledgeHttpGateway
EvidenceRerankerPort <|.. AiGameMasterHttpGateway
EvidenceSufficiencyJudgePort <|.. AiGameMasterHttpGateway

EvidenceAcquisitionApplicationService --> UnifiedCandidateSearchPort : /internal/v1/evidence-candidates/search
EvidenceAcquisitionApplicationService --> EvidenceRerankerPort : rerank
EvidenceAcquisitionApplicationService --> EvidenceSufficiencyJudgePort : judge
EvidenceAcquisitionApplicationService --> EvidenceSufficiencyPolicy : 정책 선택
EvidenceSufficiencyPolicy <|.. PlayerActionEvidenceSufficiencyPolicy
EvidenceSufficiencyPolicy <|.. ScenarioPreparationEvidenceSufficiencyPolicy
EvidenceSufficiencyPolicy <|.. OpeningSceneEvidenceSufficiencyPolicy
EvidenceSufficiencyPolicy <|.. RuleGuidanceEvidenceSufficiencyPolicy
EvidenceAcquisitionApplicationService o-- EvidenceCandidatePool
EvidenceCandidatePool o-- EvidenceRerankRequest
EvidenceCandidatePool o-- EvidenceRerankResult
EvidenceCandidatePool o-- EvidenceSufficiencyRequest
EvidenceSufficiencyJudgePort ..> SufficiencyDecision
EvidenceSufficiencyPolicy ..> FinalInsufficiency
EvidenceAcquisitionApplicationService --> AdventureValidatorAndFinalizer : ID/형식 검증·최종화
EvidenceAcquisitionApplicationService ..> EvidenceAcquisitionResult : 최종 정책 결과
AiGameMasterHttpGateway --> EvidenceController : internal HTTP API

note bottom of EvidenceAcquisitionApplicationService
UC-HR-002/003 · BR-HR-005~016 · AC-HR-005~017
검색·재시도·병합·재판단·최종화를 조정한다.
재시도는 orchestration 소유이며 adapter 안에 중첩 재시도를 두지 않는다.
end note
note right of EvidenceRerankerService
AI Game Master는 stateless 제안만 수행한다.
저장·최종 확정은 하지 않는다.
end note
note right of AdventureValidatorAndFinalizer
Adventure가 모든 ID/형식을 검증하고 최종 결과를 소유한다.
AI Game Master는 제안만 반환한다.
end note
@enduml
